<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's TCV to offer A$200 mln 2008 stock.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's TCV to offer A$200 mln 2008 stock.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Corporation of Victoria (TCV) said it will offer A$200 million of its new 7.5 percent August 2008 stock at tender on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tender is scheduled for 10.00 a.m. local time (OO00 GMT) and the result should be known at around 10.15 a.m.</p>
<p>TCV is the borrowing arm of the state of Victoria.  </p>
<p>The issue of the new stock follows the successful completion of the consolidation of its July 2000 stock into other TCV lines, announced in September.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
